{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里升起一阵难得的自豪，觉得自己也许真能担起责任。此前总怕自己做不到，所以这点把握格外珍贵。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他体验到，自己愿意承担责任时，也能获得真实的自豪感和能力感。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"波兰舞曲逐渐清晰的步态能支撑他感到自己有分量，而旋律的脆弱感让这份自豪更像一次真实的体验，而非彻底的自信。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选2\",\n        \"候选3\",\n        \"候选12\",\n        \"候选13\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他此刻近乎逞强，连压住紧张都很费力。一直担心自己担不起责任，让他连一点犹疑都像在证明自己不够可靠。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始把克制自己的不安，也当成衡量自己是否可靠的一部分。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"听感中反复聚拢的劲头与后段的焦灼适合这种费力自持的解读，而他对自身能力的怀疑为这份紧张提供了明确的心理来源。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选1\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bd0d77e8-3b15-477b-ae86-6bc959813bbf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T033001158496Z", "elapsed_seconds": 177.063, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:32:58.241213+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "01a7609810fab92065d5cb53c9337a2d6a8f3f76c42556be49e71f6e47f3b79d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgp